    sachiko "「家风这么豁达真好啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_09_427ae9e7:



    voice "2FU_1102"
    fumi "「还有，爸爸似乎也很钟意阳菜，说随时等你进家门」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_09_8c743736:



    voice "2RI_1300"
    rin "「那个，进家门意思是说做家人吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_09_4e051d9e:


