translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_09_f56284f1:



    voice "2HI_1359"
    hina "「真是，也太心急了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_09_0729bdd8:


    "阳菜这么说着，看起来很开心。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_09_e76b97ff:



    voice "2HI_1360"
    hina "「呀！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_09_4ea53ecb:


    "突然好像有什么软软的东西撞到玻璃上，大家惊讶的看向窗户。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_09_a51c88aa:


    "祥子从晾晒竿上拿下挂着的有色毛茸块状物。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_09_85e85b04:



    voice "2SA_0834"
    sachiko "「嗯？这个是不是阳菜的围巾—」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_09_932a28ef:



    voice "2HI_1361"
    hina "「咦？刚刚不是在公交车站被吹跑了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_09_92d3c23b:



    voice "2MI_1028"
    miyako "「是不是乘着风回到主人身边来了呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_09_7e2786b2:



    voice "2FU_1103"
    fumi "「好厉害！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_09_de929e30:


